 LD ends in Marlay which remind us of the  horrors of world war ii and they  immediately accuse the creators of  attack on titan of promoting the inn  justices of world war ii nothing could  be further from the truth and i may have  actually make an entire video just on  this topic because of how often I've  seen people make these claims out of  ignorance and without taking the time to  actually understand the context merely  referencing world war 2 does not mean  that the author is promoting the horrors  of World War 2 on the contrary  attack on Titan teaches us an important  lesson propaganda exists and it has  terrible consequences humans can be  manipulated into doing horrible things  and war is always a complex multifaceted  and in the end uh Turley tragic  occurrence no one who takes the time to  understand the story of attack on Titan  could ever make the claim that attack on  Titan glorifies war attack on Titan  clearly shows us the cruel truth about  war and the devastating consequences of  lies and propaganda at a time when  people who actually remember firsthand  the horrors of World War two are in  their late 80s and older it is so  important for stories like attack on  Titan to remind the younger generation  that war and propaganda are horrifying  things that should be avoided at all  costs and this is why the basement  changed everything an attack on Titan  the basement transported us from a  fantasy world where the main villains  are fantastical giant monsters into a  world that is all too similar to our own  world a world where the true enemy of  humanity is none other than humanity  itself that is such a profound narrative  shift in such an important lesson for  all of us and that is why attack on  Titan is easily my top 5 anime and manga  of all time but let me know what you  guys think how did the basement change  your perspective about the story of  attack on Titan and how did you react  when you first fully understood this  incredible twist give me your thoughts  down in the comments I always love  hearing from you if you enjoyed this  video and you want to see more you can  leave a like to let me know and if  you're new to anime uproar don't forget  to subscribe and hit that notification  bell a huge thank you to all of our  anime uproar patrons for supporting our  work I want to give a special thank you  to our pro hero tier patrons including  the one and only Gilgamesh chubs is the  man and nothing but a fan and another  huge thank you to our the one tier  patrons the ones who stand above all  other clans including baby ray ace  Ingrid ah a Lola nod of Maddy Mac and  Michael Calderon if you guys feel that  our content provides value for you and  you want to support more be sure to  check out our patreon link in the  description even donating a single  dollar will give you access to our anime  up for patron exclusive discord and you  our name will appear in our videos along  with these amazing people as always  thank you guys so much for watching I  really appreciate it and until next time  see us space cowboys  [Music]

