sent can use that power to manipulate  our understanding of history so for  example Marlins force all ldm children  to learn about how their ancestors were  evil and how they must atone for the  sins of their ancestors by showing  unquestioning loyalty to Marlay they  brainwash the LDN children by feeding  them a very one-sided version of history  that makes Marley look good and aliens  look terrible on the other hand the LDN  restorationist  accused all Marley on official history  of being nothing but manipulative lies  designed to slander ldiots but the LDN  restorationist constructed their own  version of history that puts Ameer Fritz  and the LD ins in an exclusively  positive light and they did this based  on ancient historical documents that  they found documents which talk about  ancient el dia however the LD and  restorationist s-- are actually unable  to read the ancient language that the  documents they found are written in so  they are constructing their version of  history solely based on a few vague  images that they found in these books  they don't actually have concrete  evidence for their version of history  either i completely agree with aaron  Kruger when he says that both versions  of history are clearly self-serving and  are very likely false even if they  contain some kernels of truth and this  is the beauty of attack on Titan and  this is my favorite part of the entire  story the true message of attack on  Titan is that all history is subjective  all history is written by the victors  and human beings have inherent biases  that cloud their judgment furthermore  the greatest enemy of mankind are not  zombies or giant monsters or even modern  weapons the greatest enemy of mankind is  man as hanji points out after the  revelations from the basement the Titans  are not the true enemy the true enemy is  humanity there is a famous phrase in  Latin homo homini lupus' esthe and it  means man is a wolf to man simply put  even though we as humans are so much  more intelligent than wild beasts we  often still treat each other like wild  beasts clearly the Marlins who abuse the  aliens are doing terrible and unjust  things look no further than the fate of  gracious sister  for confirmation of that fact even  though many Merlin's behave in terrible  ways towards LD ins there are also  summer lands like Theo McGrath who are  more tolerant towards ldiots on the  other hand there are of course many LD  ants were good people but there are also  LD and who are cruel and evil for  example there are no more lands behind  the walls on paradise but even without  the marlins many LD ants treat each  other terribly and if we just look at  how the minority bloodlines like the  Ackerman's were treated by the military  police behind the walls we can see that  the world of attack on titan is just  like our own world just like in our own  world no nation is completely pure or  completely evil there are good people  and bad people in every nation and there  are good people and bad people on both  sides of conflicts the world is not  black and white and the biggest message  of attack on titan is to warn us about  the power of propaganda and the tendency  of human beings to treat each other  cruelly in the name of fictional  narratives which have little basis in  reality  despite incorporating fictional titan  powers into the story the world of  attack on titan is a powerful reflection  of our own world and all of its many  problems  unfortunately this important message has  gone over the heads of some people  especially people who don't take the  time to fully comprehend the attack on  titan story i have seen way too many  individuals taking to twitter and other  social media to accuse attack on titan  of promoting authoritarianism and other  nonsense because they saw manga panels  which contained images of internment  zones and people with armbands because  they don't take the time to actually  read the story they see these panels of  LD ends in Marlay which remind us of the  horrors of world war ii and they  immediately accuse the creators of  attack on titan of promoting the inn  justices of world war ii nothing could  be further from the truth and i may have  actually make an entire video just on  this topic because of how often I've  seen people make these claims out of  ignorance and without taking the time to  actually understand the context merely  referencing world war 2 does not mean  that the author is promoting the horrors  of World War 2 on the contrary  attack on Titan teaches us an important  lesson propaganda exists and it has  terrible consequences humans can be  manipulated into doing horrible things  and war is always a complex multifaceted  and in the end uh Turley tragic  occurrence no one who takes the time to  understand the story of attack on Titan  could ever make the claim that attack on  Titan glorifies war attack on Titan  clearly shows us the cruel truth about  war and the devastating consequences of  lies and propaganda at a time when  people who actually remember firsthand  the horrors of World War two are in  their late 80s and older it is so  important for stories like attack on  Titan to remind the younger generation  that war and propaganda are horrifying  things that should be avoided at all  costs and this is why the basement  changed everything an attack on Titan  the basement transported us from a  fantasy world where the main villains  are fantastical giant monsters into a  world that is all too similar to our own  world a world where the true enemy of  humanity is none other than humanity  itself that is such a profound narrative  shift in such an important lesson for  all of us and that is why attack on  Titan is easily my top 5 anime and manga  of all time but let me know what you  guys think how did the basement change  your perspective about the story of  attack on Titan and how did you react  when you first fully understood this  incredible twist give me your thoughts  down in the comments I always love  hearing from you if you enjoyed this  video and you want to see more you can  leave a like to let me know and if  you're new to anime uproar don't forget  to subscribe and hit that notification  bell a huge thank you to all of our  anime uproar patrons for supporting our  work I want to give a special thank you  to our pro hero tier patrons including  the one and only Gilgamesh chubs is the  man and nothing but a fan and another  huge thank you to our the one tier  patrons the ones who stand above all  other clans including baby ray ace  Ingrid ah a Lola nod of Maddy Mac and  Michael Calderon if you guys feel that  our content provides value for you and  you want to support more be sure to  check out our patreon link in the  description even donating a single  dollar will give you access to our anime  up for patron exclusive discord and you  our name will appear in our videos along  with these amazing people as always  thank you guys so much for watching I  really appreciate it and until next time  see us space cowboys  [Music]
 

